NUM_REALIZATIONS 50
RANDOM_SEED 42

GRID GRID.EGRID
FIELD PORO PARAMETER poro.bgrdecl INIT_FILES:poro.bgrdecl FORWARD_INIT:True

ECLBASE CASE
SUMMARY WOPR:*
OBS_CONFIG observations.txt

INSTALL_JOB simple_model SIMPLE_MODEL
FORWARD_MODEL simple_model(<ARG0>=<IENS>)

-- Change DISTANCE to GLOBAL for a non-localized update
ANALYSIS_SET_VAR PARAMETERS FIELD DISTANCE
